.TH CARTESIAN 1
.SH NAME
cartesian \- function plotter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/cartesian
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Cartesian
is a function plotter.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Plots a sample function on labelled axes. Space redraws the graph.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Replot
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/cartesian.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
